<!-- Hero Section -->
<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 via-blue-700 to-cyan-600 text-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">About OCNJ Weekly Rentals</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-blue-100">
        Your trusted Ocean City vacation rental experts since 2016
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-gray-50 py-16">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">

      <!-- Meet Bob Idell Section -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="w-32 h-32 bg-blue-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-16 h-16 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Meet Bob Idell</h2>
            <p class="text-blue-600 font-semibold mb-4">Licensed NJ Realtor | Vacation Rental Specialist</p>

            <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600">
              <p>
                I'm Bob Idell, and I've been helping families find their perfect Ocean City vacation rental since 2016.
                As a licensed New Jersey Realtor with <strong>Berkshire Hathaway HomeServices Fox & Roach</strong>,
                I bring professional expertise and local knowledge to every rental inquiry.
              </p>
              <p>
                In 2024, I was honored to receive the <strong>Chairman's Circle Gold</strong> award,
                recognizing top-performing agents in the Berkshire Hathaway network. This achievement reflects
                my commitment to exceptional service for both property owners and vacationing families.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Credentials -->
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">
                Licensed NJ Realtor
              </span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800">
                Chairman's Circle Gold 2024
              </span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-green-100 text-green-800">
                8+ Years Experience
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Why Ocean City Section -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Why Ocean City, NJ?</h2>

        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600">
          <p>
            Ocean City has been called <strong>"America's Greatest Family Resort"</strong> since 1901, and it continues
            to earn that title every summer. As a "dry town" (no alcohol sales), Ocean City offers a safe,
            family-friendly atmosphere that's perfect for creating lasting vacation memories.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">8 Miles of Pristine Beaches</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Clean, lifeguard-protected beaches with ADA access</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">2.5-Mile Boardwalk</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Classic amusements, dining, and family entertainment</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Family-Friendly Atmosphere</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Dry town since 1909 - safe for all ages</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Year-Round Events</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Night in Venice, Baby Parade, concerts & festivals</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- By The Numbers Section -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">OCNJ Weekly Rentals By The Numbers</h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
          <div>
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600"><%= number_with_delimiter(Property.count) %>+</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600">Properties Available</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600">8+</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600">Years Experience</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600">5</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600">Neighborhoods Covered</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600">24hr</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600">Response Time</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Our Commitment Section -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Our Commitment to You</h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Local Expertise</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              With 8+ years specializing in Ocean City rentals, I know every neighborhood, beach access point,
              and hidden gem. I can help you find the perfect property for your family's needs.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Personalized Service</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              You'll work directly with me - not a call center. I respond to every inquiry within 24 hours
              and provide recommendations based on your specific requirements.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Verified Properties</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              Every property in our database is verified for accuracy. We work directly with property owners
              and management companies to ensure you get what you expect.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">No Hidden Fees</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              Unlike booking platforms that charge 10-15% service fees, we provide transparent pricing.
              The price you see is the price you pay.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA Section -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 text-white text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to Find Your Perfect Rental?</h2>
        <p class="text-blue-100 mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Browse our collection of Ocean City vacation rentals or contact me directly for personalized recommendations.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <%= link_to "Browse Properties", properties_path,
              class: "px-6 py-3 bg-white text-blue-600 font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors" %>
          <%= link_to "Contact Bob", contact_path,
              class: "px-6 py-3 bg-blue-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-400 transition-colors border border-blue-400" %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Last Updated -->
      <p class="text-center text-sm text-gray-400 mt-8">
        Last updated: <%= Date.today.strftime("%B %Y") %>
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
